WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.032 --> 00:00:08.496
"Have you heard the term 'assembly-line wedding-parent makeup'?"

2
00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:17.712
During consultations, we often hear parents say, "At my first child's wedding, I got assembly-line makeup."

3
00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:31.968
By assembly-line, we mean a system where many people wait together and hair and makeup are rushed through in a short set time — like mass production on a factory line.

4
00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:37.992
In a setup like that, can each parent's individual look and needs really be reflected?

5
00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:49.008
Picture it: the bride, groom, both sets of parents, family, and relatives all waiting in line with number tags for their turn.

6
00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:53.280
That's what we call assembly-line wedding-parent makeup.

7
00:00:53.616 --> 00:01:02.256
At large, bride-focused wedding shops especially, the parents' makeup often gets scheduled in as an afterthought.

8
00:01:02.592 --> 00:01:05.448
So why does it become assembly-line like this?

9
00:01:05.784 --> 00:01:11.424
It comes down to a longstanding practice of wedding planners funneling clients to shops they're tied to.

10
00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:21.192
Only part of what the customer pays actually reaches the shop, so the shop makes up for it in volume — and that volume is what turns into assembly-line service.

11
00:01:21.528 --> 00:01:25.344
It's an old habit in the wedding industry.

12
00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:35.472
Many parents who went through this still say, years later, "I never want to look at my first child's wedding photos again."

13
00:01:35.808 --> 00:01:46.656
With so many people waiting, your own time slot gets cut short, and if you don't like the result, there's no time to fix it before heading straight to the wedding hall.

14
00:01:46.992 --> 00:01:50.856
A wedding isn't just the bride and groom's day.

15
00:01:51.192 --> 00:01:56.808
It's a day the parents should be celebrated and shine too.

16
00:01:57.144 --> 00:02:02.448
So even if it's not a big, flashy brand,

17
00:02:02.784 --> 00:02:13.488
a shop where an experienced head artist who understands middle-aged faces personally does the hair and makeup can give far more satisfying results.

18
00:02:13.824 --> 00:02:23.376
For the parents' dignity on the wedding day, mass-production, assembly-line makeup is worth thinking twice about.
